      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "## Record Storage\n\nThis section appends the structured task record to Google Sheets. It stores all fields including requester details, AI analysis, priority score, checklist, and original request text for tracking, reporting, and manual review by ops team.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7ea3ca7e-37d5-4daa-979a-4e371d550a0e",
      "name": "Sticky Note7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -4016,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 752,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "# Ops Intake Copilot Form Only Workflow\n## How it works:\nThis workflow transforms messy ops requests from forms into structured tasks with AI classification and notifications. Incoming webhook POST requests are normalized, validated for required fields, and combined into text sent to Gemini AI for request type detection, summary generation, urgency analysis, owner suggestion, and actionable checklist creation. Priority is calculated based on urgency and category. Duplicates are prevented through Google Sheets lookup. Valid tasks are stored with full details, requester receives confirmation email, internal team gets Slack alert, and webhook returns task details. Validation and duplicate checks ensure data quality throughout.\n## Setup Steps:\n1. Webhook Setup Copy ops-intake-form webhook URL for form integration.\n2. Credentials Add Google Sheets, Gmail, Slack, and Gemini credentials.\n3. Sheet Setup Create Google Sheet with task columns and share with service account.\n4. Test Request POST sample JSON body to webhook URL using Postman.\n5. Activate Workflow Save and activate for production use.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
